speechtext:
I am informed by the Departments of the Environment, Energy, Mines and Resources and Transport as follows:
(a)	1972-73, $20,000.00; 1973-74, $34,250.00; 1974-75, $58.75;
(b)	The Ministry of Transport has no record of ever providing funds to assist the Arctic Institute of North America, (c) August 6, 1968, $10,000.00; November 8, 1968, $2,000.00; October 15, 1970, $1,550.30; November 29, 1971, $9,937.48.
